# Nuitka frozen-binary build artifacts (C4 spike + ongoing builds):
# `serve.build` is ~6.5GB of intermediate `.o`s (keep locally for ccache
# benefit on rebuilds); `serve.dist` is the ~1.5GB frozen binary + bundled
# libs/data. Both are reproducible from pyproject + uv.lock + serve.py.
ai_worker/build_nuitka/
ai_worker/.venv/